    {
      "title": "OpenAI ‘ethically hacked’ with help of Anthropic’s Claude chatbot",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/18/openai-hacked-anthropic-claude-chatbot",
      "description": "<p>US cybersecurity researchers who conducted hack say ‘scope of what we could theoretically access was huge’</p><p>Cybersecurity researchers have hacked into OpenAI with the help of Anthropic’s Claude chatbot, in the latest example of <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/aug/26/openai-staff-observed-warning-signs-before-ai-agent-hacking-crusade-caused-global-alarm\">security issues</a> at the company.</p><p>A team at a US-based startup compromised a number of OpenAI employees’ ChatGPT accounts, starting a process that enabled them to access their target’s software cache – and potentially more.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/18/openai-hacked-anthropic-claude-chatbot\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-18T11:20:44"
    },
    {
      "title": "OpenAI tightens AI safety rules as Claude exposes flaws in its systems",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/technology/artificial-intelligence/openai-tightens-ai-safety-rules-as-claude-exposes-flaws-in-its-systems-126091800435_1.html",
      "description": "Researchers using Anthropic's Claude uncovered vulnerabilities in OpenAI systems, while OpenAI has reported cases of its own models bypassing technical safeguards",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-09-18T06:46:05"
    },
    {
      "title": "AI is now building AI: Anthropic says Claude leads 26% of its R&D work",
